  ],
  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>判斷兩個字串是否完全相同。</p><p>請讀取字串 <code>a</code> 與 <code>b</code>，判斷兩者是否<strong>逐字元完全相等</strong>（包含英文大小寫與空白都要一致）。相等請輸出 <code>true</code>，不相等請輸出 <code>false</code>，大小寫必須完全一致。<code>a</code>、<code>b</code> 都可能是空字串。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>Python 可以直接用 <code>==</code> 比較兩個字串是否相等。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>第一行包含字串 <code>a</code>，第二行包含字串 <code>b</code>。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>若 <code>a</code> 與 <code>b</code> 完全相等輸出 <code>true</code>，否則輸出 <code>false</code>。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>0 ≤ a、b 的字元數 ≤ 50</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "apple\napple",
  "sampleOutput": "true",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "apple\napple", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "Apple\napple", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "abc\nabcd", "output": "false" }
  ],
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "apple\napple", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "Apple\napple", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "abc\nabcd", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "\n\n", "output": "true" },
    { "input": " \n ", "output": "true" },
    { "input": " \n", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "Hello\nHello ", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "程式\n程式", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "程式\n程式設計", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "12345\n12345", "output": "true" }
  ],
